Ruach. Unity. Community.

Get ready to elevate your Elul with an unforgettable night of Jewish music - just in time for the Yamim Noraim.

Yeshiva University is proud to bring together students, alumni, and the broader Jewish community in a celebration of Jewish pride, spirit, and culture. At a time when unity matters more than ever, this concert carries the Ruach of YU beyond the campus - into the heart of Am Yisrael.

